$body".toByteArray()) } written = true return emptyList() } } } ./gradlew :ksp:demo -Pmain=workbench.ksp.l09.demo.RepackDemoKt labs/ksp/src/demo/kotlin/workbench/ksp/l09/demo/RepackDemo.kt Repacking fails with COMPILATION_ERROR and two Redeclaration: errors, one in the generated LampExtra.kt at 3:12 and one in your Lamp.kt at 6:12. The extension compiles and prints desk.inventoryCard() returns: Lamp: name=desk lamp, bulbs=1, shade=null. A Java caller writes LampExtraKt.inventoryCard(desk): the extension is a static method of the file's class, and Lamp itself still has no member. Three questions pick the tool: change a class, a compiler plugin; a few times on a few classes, reflection; a KSP processor exists, KSP; otherwise kapt. Arrow: setup, the compiler plug-in and the KSP plugin docs Koin Annotations with KSP (Koin docs) docs
